Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:03:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] backport: fix WinGet searches and Classic build

Use a catalog-default selector for empty COM searches. Restore the bounded CLI search and installer URL handling, and remove the unsupported Agent broker path from Classic.

Upstream-Commit: 2a03ddc55d9a80ad17710960b1b6a46f88aa5175
Upstream-PR: Devolutions/UniGetUI#5641

Classic-Source-Commit: 1e22e546ad0f481a4cdab3d3de630b43bbdf57fc
